WEBVTT

00:08:29.553 --> 00:08:33.472
and speech synthesis is getting
more and more humanlike.

00:08:33.861 --> 00:08:39.274
So this little device will have a latency
of maybe one to three seconds.

00:08:39.298 --> 00:08:42.782
It can't quite work like humans,
which are instantaneous,

00:08:42.806 --> 00:08:46.012
but other than this
one-to-three-second delay,

00:08:46.036 --> 00:08:51.126
I think the tourists can already
buy devices that are usable.

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:54.332
In three years, these will be
very good devices.

00:08:54.356 --> 00:08:58.110
Now, one caveat is,
when you said everywhere in the world,

00:08:58.134 --> 00:09:00.303
so you've got to have enough data